<section class="ls-sheet" aria-labelledby="h-log">
<header class="ls-sh">
<span class="ls-sh-n" aria-hidden="true">07</span>
<h2 class="ls-sh-t" id="h-log">The race, hour by hour</h2>
<span class="ls-sh-m" data-tpl="led.secLogNote">94 hours</span>
</header>
<div data-block="log">
<div class="ls-lg">
<div class="ls-lg-y">
<span class="ls-seg">01</span>
<span class="ls-lg-c">Fri 14:00</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="ls-lg-t">160 souls start</h3>
<p class="ls-lg-b">Friday 14 August 2026. The whole field lines up in the corral for the first 6.7 km loop.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-lg">
<div class="ls-lg-y">
<span class="ls-seg">31</span>
<span class="ls-lg-c">Sat 20:00</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="ls-lg-t">Mike Egan out</h3>
<p class="ls-lg-b">The former US Marine, racing in a wheelchair, completes 30 yards before failing to finish yard 31.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-lg">
<div class="ls-lg-y">
<span class="ls-seg">52</span>
<span class="ls-lg-c">Sun 17:00</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="ls-lg-t">Last woman standing</h3>
<p class="ls-lg-b">Caroline Maria Bolte stops at 52 yards and 348 km — a German women&#39;s backyard record in her first backyard ultra.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-lg">
<div class="ls-lg-y">
<span class="ls-seg">68</span>
<span class="ls-lg-c">Mon 09:00</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="ls-lg-t">The record holder goes</h3>
<p class="ls-lg-b">Hendrik Boury, holder of the German national record, is out on Monday morning at 68 yards. The whole of Season 1 ended at 67.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-lg">
<div class="ls-lg-y">
<span class="ls-seg">80</span>
<span class="ls-lg-c">Mon 21:00</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="ls-lg-t">Two left</h3>
<p class="ls-lg-b">Norman Mascher-Aspensjö is out. Dowdle and El Osrouti keep starting on the hour, alone together.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-lg">
<div class="ls-lg-y">
<span class="ls-seg">91</span>
<span class="ls-lg-c">Tue 08:00</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="ls-lg-t">German-soil record falls</h3>
<p class="ls-lg-b">No backyard ultra in Germany had gone past 90 yards. The two of them run through 91 side by side on the fourth night.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-lg">
<div class="ls-lg-y">
<span class="ls-seg">94</span>
<span class="ls-lg-c">Tue 11:00</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="ls-lg-t">One final solo lap</h3>
<p class="ls-lg-b">El Osrouti does not start yard 94. Dowdle runs it alone on Tuesday morning and the race is over.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
